{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant,  underwater world as a fearless mermaid on a mission to clean up the ocean. With an accessible side-view control scheme and a laid-back pace, you\u2019ll swim, fight and explore.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>Wield a torpedo-shrimp rockets, sea-urchin chakrams and more to dispatch sharks, eels and fantastical sea monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Cleanse</strong><br>Gather pearls, treasures\u2014and toxic pollution. Feed friendly crabs to recycle trash and clear pathways to hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong><br>Challenge massive, multi-phase foes like the glowing Anglerfish, each with its own attack patterns and weak points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Style</strong><br>Colorful art, cute animations and a relaxing soundtrack create a welcoming experience for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926240/extras/731116934d5eaa7fa1ea40520a755ae7.poster.avif?t=1761939549\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926240/extras/731116934d5eaa7fa1ea40520a755ae7.webm?t=1761939549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926240/extras/731116934d5eaa7fa1ea40520a755ae7.mp4?t=1761939549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for a quick pick-up-and-play session or to chase every hidden collectible, this mermaid adventure offers something for everyone\u2014dive in and make the ocean sparkle!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/39262